How's it going? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Kelly: </span> Hello, Bruno! I'm in a hurry, I have a lot of things to do today. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Bruno: </span>Oh, I'm sorry, but I need to talk to you.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Kelly: </span>Really? Can it be later? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Bruno: </span>No, sorry. It's really urgent.  <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Kelly: </span>OK. Please, sit down. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Bruno: </span> Thanks. Well, the company doesn't have a computer security specialist, and I consider that it's fundamental.  <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Kelly: </span> Hmm. We have many engineers; In the case of any problem, they can solve it instantly. I don't think we need that many computer specialists; it can be like reinventing the wheel! <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Bruno: </span> Yes, but they don't have to take care of networks all the time. Imagine that we have a security problem that threatens to make us lose our information systems. That's when a computer security specialist is necessary since their main duties and responsibilities are related to security measure implementation. They can protect the company from cyber-attacks, such as hacking, and they can also avoid data loss. <br />"}, {"time": "65000", "image": "enpe8n4le01ob02re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">  Kelly: </span> What do you mean by hacking?  <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">  Bruno: </span> Hacking is an unscrupulous and unauthorized access to private systems with the purpose of targeting companies to steal valuable information. Hackers can manipulate this information and bring the computer systems to a halt.  <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">  Kelly: </span> We can't take that risk! Hmm, you're right! We don't have the skills to solve those problems now because we aren't security specialists.  <br />"}, {"time": "92000", "image": "enpe8n4le01ob02re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Bruno: </span> Exactly! Moreover, a computer security specialist is really important because he can implement recovery plans in case of a security breach. He can install a firewall and train our staff on this security procedure. So, in this way, we don't have to manage the company's security alone because we can count on a professional for that matter. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Kelly: </span>All right! Can you help me with that, please? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Bruno: </span>  Why me? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Kelly: </span>Because you are the expert; it's not rocket science!<br />"}]}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "title": ""}, {"_data": [], "contents": [{"value": "Ruleta 1.jpg", "type": "img"}, {"value": "Ruleta 2.jpg", "type": "img"}, {"value": "Ruleta 3.jpg", "type": "img"}], "type": "static", "template_override": 1, "id": 2, "title": ""}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar"}]}